 "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >一本正在被擦除的漫画</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你在一本漫画里醒来。脚下是纸张,线条是墨水,天空是网点。而这一页正在</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >缩小。一块橡皮擦日复一日地从边缘向内啃食,凡是它触及之处都会直接消失。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >没有武器,没有工具,没有营地。你只有一本速写本。这就是全部的计划。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/c6df339b789fe832abeeee9a21e23fbf.poster.avif?t=1788935185\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/c6df339b789fe832abeeee9a21e23fbf.webm?t=1788935185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/c6df339b789fe832abeeee9a21e23fbf.mp4?t=1788935185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >你需要什么就画什么</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这里没有制作菜单。你翻开速写本,页面上是斧头形状的灰色</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >引导线。你用手描摹它们。然后你手中就多了一把斧头。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的线条不会自动吸附到引导线上。这一步全靠你自己,而页面能看出你画得有多准。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >墨水就是一切</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >只有一种资源,却贯穿一切。每一笔都要消耗墨水,每一个符文也是。每座方尖碑的花费都</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >很高。击中敌人时,它们会溅出墨水。夜里会下墨水雨,既能补充你的墨水</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >也会让你感到寒冷。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/60d64bbfbaa836d412bd78860e708fbb.poster.avif?t=1788935185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/60d64bbfbaa836d412bd78860e708fbb.webm?t=1788935185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/60d64bbfbaa836d412bd78860e708fbb.mp4?t=1788935185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >把橡皮擦逼退</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >页面上矗立着九座方尖碑。走近,按住按键,支付墨水,橡皮擦就会后退三十</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >米。这是它唯一听得懂的语言。若一整天没有为方尖碑重新注入墨水,它就会</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >再次逼近。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/74185754b645b40c3d68876bdf5d5207.poster.avif?t=1788935185\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/74185754b645b40c3d68876bdf5d5207.webm?t=1788935185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/74185754b645b40c3d68876bdf5d5207.mp4?t=1788935185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >熬过黑夜</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >饥饿、口渴和体温会持续下降。你的工具会先出现裂纹,然后碎裂。&quot;未完成者&quot;会在</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >天黑后出现,没有人给它们上过色。搭建一座能撑住的庇护所,或者画一张床</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >睡过这一夜。</p>",
 "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >一本正在被擦除的漫画</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你在一本漫画里醒来。脚下是纸张,线条是墨水,天空是网点。而这一页正在</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >缩小。一块橡皮擦日复一日地从边缘向内啃食,凡是它触及之处都会直接消失。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >没有武器,没有工具,没有营地。你只有一本速写本。这就是全部的计划。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/c6df339b789fe832abeeee9a21e23fbf.poster.avif?t=1788935185\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/c6df339b789fe832abeeee9a21e23fbf.webm?t=1788935185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/c6df339b789fe832abeeee9a21e23fbf.mp4?t=1788935185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >你需要什么就画什么</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这里没有制作菜单。你翻开速写本,页面上是斧头形状的灰色</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >引导线。你用手描摹它们。然后你手中就多了一把斧头。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的线条不会自动吸附到引导线上。这一步全靠你自己,而页面能看出你画得有多准。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >墨水就是一切</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >只有一种资源,却贯穿一切。每一笔都要消耗墨水,每一个符文也是。每座方尖碑的花费都</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >很高。击中敌人时,它们会溅出墨水。夜里会下墨水雨,既能补充你的墨水</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >也会让你感到寒冷。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/60d64bbfbaa836d412bd78860e708fbb.poster.avif?t=1788935185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/60d64bbfbaa836d412bd78860e708fbb.webm?t=1788935185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/60d64bbfbaa836d412